1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,835
A customer requests records to understand data use.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:07,343
Before delivery, the analyst's access is revoked.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:13,571
Let's walk through delivering a no-code fix for this design bug in Trajectory.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,381
Beyond a chat loop, decisions and checks make changes accountable.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,653
Grounded in BMO's aggregate engine.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,628
The owner reports the delivery problem in plain language.

7
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:32,108
The workbench reproduces the original delivery.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,901
It will queue the request and revoke staff access.

9
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,721
The export still went out.

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,864
When should access be checked?

11
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,611
At request time, or at delivery time?

12
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:54,332
In a separate run, request time keeps the original authorization.

13
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,539
It records one audit and one export.

14
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:07,208
In another run, the owner selects delivery time.

15
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:14,844
Resolve delivery can synthesize, check, apply, and replay the change.

16
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,187
Next, a separate completed delivery-time run.

17
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,691
The independent checks cover revoked and authorized access.

18
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:40,025
They compare the original, an authored wrong fix, and the candidate.

19
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,029
The wrong fix releases records without an audit.

20
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:53,487
The Muse candidate satisfies both examples.

21
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:01,681
The policy blocks revoked access and orders audit before release.

22
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,867
The checked source was applied to the private run.

23
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:13,784
The replayed scenario blocked delivery with zero exports.

24
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:21,891
A separate authorized request is interrupted and recovered.

25
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,731
The audit remains saved during the interruption.

26
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,648
Recovery completes delivery once, with the audit preserved.

27
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:39,097
The receipt connects the decision, checks, and observed result.

28
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,141
The result is ready to review.

29
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,456
Your outcome. Your decision. Software you can verify.

